# Component organization (minimal)

Keep component rules short and practical. Favor existing patterns in `app/components`.

## Placement

- Put reusable primitives in `app/components/ui/`.
- Put feature-specific UI in its feature folder (for example `auth/`, `dashboard/`, `landing/`, `support/`).
- Keep route-level data loading/mutations in routes and services, not in shared UI primitives.

## Boundaries

- `ui` components should be presentation-focused and reusable.
- Feature components can compose UI components and local hooks.
- Move business workflows to `app/services` when logic grows beyond view orchestration.

## Naming and imports

- Component file names are lowercase and hyphenated.
- Use PascalCase for component function names.
- Use `#/*` imports inside `app/`, without file extensions.
